title: Job 38–41: The LORD Answers out of the Whirlwind
description: The Job class, part 4 of 5: the LORD answers Job out of the whirlwind, the foundations of the earth and the corner stone, the wild beasts of His providence, Job's hand upon his mouth, behemoth and leviathan, from the Job 38 to 41 studies.
output: lessons/job/job-38-41-out-of-the-whirlwind.html

# The Job class, part 4 of 5. Slide text is the author's own sentences from the Job 38-41 studies
# (studies/data/books/Job.json: 17032, 17039, 17040, 17042, 17054-17056), with the "sons of God" teaching (15859),
# selected and set in chapter order. Verses typed in the studies are shown from the KJV.
